  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "打扰一下，\n请你听我说。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "625362704E004E0BFF0C000A8BF74F60542C62118BF4300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一时突发奇想就开启了一项服务，\n但现在遇上了麻烦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0065F67A8153D1594760F35C315F00542F4E864E009879670D52A1FF0C000A4F4673B0572890474E0A4E869EBB70E6300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "服务内容是为那些\n因为常做噩梦而睡眠不足的人们<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n施展催眠术，让他们睡着。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670D52A151855BB9662F4E3A90A34E9B000A56E04E3A5E38505A566968A6800C776177204E0D8DB376844EBA4EEC00100001BE00000A65BD5C5550AC7720672FFF0C8BA94ED64EEC77617740300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟最近因为做噩梦\n睡不安稳的人也挺多的……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF67008FD156E04E3A505A566968A6000A77614E0D5B897A3376844EBA4E5F633A591A76842026202600100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我很快就遇上了麻烦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662115F885FEB5C3190474E0A4E869EBB70E6FF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顾客带来的缠红鹤\n就是不睡！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987E5BA25E26676576847F207EA29E64000A5C31662F4E0D7761FF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鹤呃。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9E64544330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "或许是因为它肚子里累积了太多能量，\n它完全睡不了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62168BB8662F56E04E3A5B83809A5B5091CC7D2F79EF4E86592A591A80FD91CFFF0C000A5B835B8C516877614E0D4E862026202600100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "梦唔……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68A65514202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "服务才刚刚开始，\n梦梦蚀应该也很紧张。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670D52A1624D521A521A5F0059CBFF0C000A68A668A686805E948BE54E5F5F887D275F20300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我想委托你，\n请你给梦梦蚀做个示范吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621160F359D462584F60FF0C000A8BF74F607ED968A668A68680505A4E2A793A83035427300200100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "具体来说，就是对缠红鹤\n使出<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>催眠术<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>和<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>食梦<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51774F5367658BF4FF0C5C31662F5BF97F207EA29E64000A4F7F51FA00100002FF00000650AC7720672F00100002FF000000548C00100002FF00000698DF68A600100002FF000000FF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请对缠红鹤\n使出<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>催眠术<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>和<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>食梦<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF75BF97F207EA29E64000A4F7F51FA00100002FF00000650AC7720672F00100002FF000000548C00100002FF00000698DF68A600100002FF000000FF0100100002011401BB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "梦嗯……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "68A655EF202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想让缠红鹤睡着……\n它都三天没睡了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F38BA97F207EA29E647761774020262026000A5B8390FD4E0959296CA177614E862026202600100002011401BC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
