      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9E645443266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "缠红鹤睡了一觉，\n好像完全恢复精神了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我还会再来的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƼ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
