      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你！这样一来，\n“梦梦蚀好梦”可以由<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n梦梦蚀来为顾客服务了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
